#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "List or filter backends {#list-or-filter-backends}"
msgstr "Ilista o i-filter ang mga backend {#list-or-filter-backends}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"available\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"available\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "List backends available to you {#list-backends-available-to-you}"
msgstr "Ilista ang mga backend na available sa iyo {#list-backends-available-to-you}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use either Qiskit or IBM Quantum Platform to view a list of backends available to you, or to search for a particular backend.\n"
msgstr "Maaari kang gumamit ng Qiskit o IBM Quantum Platform para makita ang listahan ng mga backend na available sa iyo, o para maghanap ng isang partikular na backend.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"QPU names\">\n"
"QPUs hosted on IBM Cloud&reg; have names that begin with `ibm_*`. All QPUs are given a city name - for example, `ibm_kingston`. This name does not indicate where the actual QPU is hosted.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mga pangalan ng QPU\">\n"
"Ang mga QPU na naka-host sa IBM Cloud&reg; ay may mga pangalang nagsisimula sa `ibm_*`. Lahat ng QPU ay pinangalanan ayon sa isang lungsod - halimbawa, `ibm_kingston`. Hindi ipinapakita ng pangalang ito kung saan talaga naka-host ang QPU.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-available\" label=\"View backends with Qiskit\">\n"
"        Use the [`QiskitRuntimeService.backends()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backends) method, as shown in the next code block. This method returns a list of [`IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend) instances.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-available\" label=\"View backends with Qiskit\">\n"
"        Gamitin ang pamamaraan ng [`QiskitRuntimeService.backends()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backends), gaya ng ipinapakita sa susunod na code block. Nagbabalik ang pamamaraang ito ng listahan ng mga instance ng [`IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        To run the following code, be sure you have already authenticated to the service. See [Set up your IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup) for more details.\n"
msgstr "        Para patakbuhin ang sumusunod na code, tiyaking napatunayan mo na ang serbisyo. Tingnan ang [I-set up ang iyong IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup) para sa karagdagang detalye.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        To search for a specific backend, use the [`QiskitRuntimeService.backend()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend) method (note that this is singular: *backend*), which takes the name of the backend as the input parameter and returns an [`IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend) instance representing that particular backend:\n"
msgstr "        Para maghanap ng isang partikular na backend, gamitin ang pamamaraan ng [`QiskitRuntimeService.backend()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend) (pansinin na ito ay singular: *backend*), na tumatanggap ng pangalan ng backend bilang input parameter at nagbabalik ng instance ng [`IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend) na kumakatawan sa partikular na backend na iyon:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-available\" label=\"View backends on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        To view the backends you have access to, navigate to the list of backends on the [Compute resources page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) (note that your selected region might impact the QPUs listed). Click the filter icon and choose either \"All my instances\" or a specific instance name to see the available QPUs.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-available\" label=\"View backends on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Para makita ang mga backend na maa-access mo, pumunta sa listahan ng mga backend sa [pahina ng Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) (pansinin na ang iyong napiling rehiyon ay maaaring makaapekto sa mga QPU na nakalista). I-click ang filter icon at piliin ang \"All my instances\" o isang partikular na pangalan ng instance para makita ang mga available na QPU.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"   If you are logged in to a specific instance or region, or if you initialized the service with a specific instance or region by using `QiskitRuntimeService()`, only the backends available to you on that instance or region are returned.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"   Kung naka-log in ka sa isang partikular na instance o rehiyon, o kung ini-initialize mo ang serbisyo gamit ang isang partikular na instance o rehiyon sa pamamagitan ng `QiskitRuntimeService()`, ang mga backend na available lamang sa iyo sa instance o rehiyong iyon ang ibabalik.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter backends {#filter-backends}"
msgstr "I-filter ang mga backend {#filter-backends}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-filter\" label=\"Filter by properties with Qiskit\">\n"
"        You can filter the available backends by their [configuration](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/models-backend-configuration) or [status](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/models-backend-status). For more general filters, set the `filters` argument to a function that accepts a backend object and returns `True` if it meets your criteria. Refer to the [API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backends) for more details.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-filter\" label=\"Filter by properties with Qiskit\">\n"
"        Maaari mong i-filter ang mga available na backend ayon sa kanilang [configuration](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/models-backend-configuration) o [status](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/models-backend-status). Para sa mas pangkalahatang mga filter, itakda ang argument na `filters` sa isang function na tumatanggap ng backend object at nagbabalik ng `True` kung natutugunan nito ang iyong mga pamantayan. Sumangguni sa [dokumentasyon ng API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backends) para sa karagdagang detalye.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        The following code returns only backends that fit these criteria and are available to you _on your currently selected instance_:\n"
msgstr "        Ang sumusunod na code ay nagbabalik lamang ng mga backend na nakakatugon sa mga pamantayang ito at available sa iyo _sa iyong kasalukuyang napiling instance_:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '        *   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Are real quantum devices (`simulator=False`)\n"
msgstr "Tunay na quantum device ang mga ito (`simulator=False`)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '        *   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Are currently operational (`operational=True`)\n"
msgstr "Kasalukuyang operational (`operational=True`)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '        *   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Have at least a hundred qubits (`min_num_qubits=100`)\n"
msgstr "May kahit isang daang qubit (`min_num_qubits=100`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        A similar method is [`QiskitRuntimeService.least_busy()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#least_busy), which takes the same filters as `backends()` but returns the backend that matches the filters and has the least number of jobs pending in the queue:\n"
msgstr "        Isang katulad na pamamaraan ay ang [`QiskitRuntimeService.least_busy()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#least_busy), na tumatanggap ng parehong mga filter tulad ng `backends()` ngunit nagbabalik ng backend na nakakatugon sa mga filter at may pinakakaunting bilang ng mga job na nakabinbin sa queue:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-filter\" label=\"Filter by properties on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        To view the backends you have access to, view the table on the [Compute resources page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers). Click the filter icon to see filter options. You can filter by processor type and status. Note also that you can sort the table by any column by hovering over a column title, and then clicking the arrows that appear.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-filter\" label=\"Filter by properties on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Para makita ang mga backend na maa-access mo, tingnan ang talahanayan sa [pahina ng Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers). I-click ang filter icon para makita ang mga opsyon ng filter. Maaari kang mag-filter ayon sa uri ng processor at status. Pansinin din na maaari mong ayusin ang talahanayan ayon sa anumang column sa pamamagitan ng pag-hover sa pamagat ng column, at pagkatapos ay pag-click sa mga arrow na lalabas.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Static backend information {#static-backend-information}"
msgstr "Static na impormasyon ng backend {#static-backend-information}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some information about a backend does not change regularly, such as its name, [version](#qpu-versioning), the number of qubits it has, its processor type (the bird family name, which indicates the [topology](#coupling-map) and approximate qubit count), and the types of features it supports. This information is available as attributes of the `backend` object. For a full list of attributes, see the [`IBMBackend` API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend).  Find more information on versioning in the [QPU versioning](#qpu-versioning) section below.\n"
msgstr "Ang ilang impormasyon tungkol sa isang backend ay hindi regular na nagbabago, tulad ng pangalan nito, [bersyon](#qpu-versioning), bilang ng mga qubit nito, uri ng processor nito (ang pangalan ng bird family, na nagpapahiwatig ng [topology](#coupling-map) at tinatayang bilang ng qubit), at ang mga uri ng feature na sinusuportahan nito. Ang impormasyong ito ay available bilang mga katangian ng `backend` object. Para sa buong listahan ng mga katangian, tingnan ang [dokumentasyon ng `IBMBackend` API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend). Hanapin ang karagdagang impormasyon sa versioning sa seksyong [QPU versioning](#qpu-versioning) sa ibaba.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A backend's region (the location of the data center where your data and experiments will be hosted and processed) is listed in its detailed information card on the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page on IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr "Ang rehiyon ng isang backend (ang lokasyon ng data center kung saan iho-host at ipoproseso ang iyong data at mga eksperimento) ay nakalista sa detalyadong information card nito sa pahina ng [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) sa IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-backend\" label=\"View backend information with Qiskit\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-backend\" label=\"View backend information with Qiskit\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"IQP-backend\" label=\"View backend information on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"IQP-backend\" label=\"View backend information on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Navigate to the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page to view a table of all QPUs, then click the name of any QPU to open its detailed information card. Find backend information under the Details section of the card.\n"
msgstr "    Pumunta sa pahina ng [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) para makita ang talahanayan ng lahat ng QPU, pagkatapos ay i-click ang pangalan ng anumang QPU para buksan ang detalyadong information card nito. Hanapin ang impormasyon ng backend sa ilalim ng seksyong Details ng card.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "QPU versioning {#qpu-versioning}"
msgstr "QPU versioning {#qpu-versioning}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each QPU has a version number in the form X.Y.Z (major.minor.revision). A circuit compiled for a given version number is guaranteed to run on that QPU. If the revision number changes, the circuit will continue to run. If the major or minor number changes, the circuit is not guaranteed to run, although it may do so.\n"
msgstr "Bawat QPU ay may version number sa anyo ng X.Y.Z (major.minor.revision). Ang isang circuit na na-compile para sa isang partikular na version number ay garantisadong tatakbo sa QPU na iyon. Kung magbago ang revision number, magpapatuloy na tatakbo ang circuit. Kung magbago ang major o minor number, hindi garantisadong tatakbo ang circuit, bagaman posible pa rin.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The revision version number will increment for fixes that do not break the existing compiled circuit.\n"
msgstr "Mag-i-increment ang revision version number para sa mga pag-aayos na hindi nagpapasira sa umiiral na compiled circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The code example earlier in [this section](#static-backend-information) demonstrates how to find a backend's version. On IBM Quantum Platform, you can view the version on a QPU's detailed information card (click the QPU's name on the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) table to open the card).\n"
msgstr "Ang code example kanina sa [seksyong ito](#static-backend-information) ay nagpapakita kung paano mahanap ang bersyon ng isang backend. Sa IBM Quantum Platform, maaari mong makita ang bersyon sa detalyadong information card ng isang QPU (i-click ang pangalan ng QPU sa talahanayan ng [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) para buksan ang card).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The conditions under which a version or revision number can change are listed in the following table.\n"
msgstr "Nakalista sa sumusunod na talahanayan ang mga kondisyon kung saan maaaring magbago ang bersyon o revision number.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Major version | Minor version | Revision version |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"|Sample changes| Warmup / cool-down cycles | QPU software updates |\n"
"|Major changes to the control electronics| Swapping out some electronics, if the replacement appreciably affects operation| Manual calibrations to improve fidelities |\n"
"|Moving the QPU to a new location, if significant behavior changes result| Dropping a gate for some duration of time due to calibration issues, and corrections cannot readily be done in software| Small electronics changes that don’t affect operation |\n"
"| |Changing the direction of a CNOT gate | |\n"
"<span id=\"native-gates-ops\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""
"| Major version | Minor version | Revision version |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"|Mga pagbabago sa sample| Mga ikot ng warmup / cool-down | Mga software update ng QPU |\n"
"|Malalaking pagbabago sa control electronics| Pagpapalit ng ilang electronics, kung malaki ang epekto ng kapalit sa operasyon| Mga mano-manong kalibrasyon para mapabuti ang mga fidelity |\n"
"|Paglipat ng QPU sa bagong lokasyon, kung may malalaking pagbabago sa gawi ang resulta| Pag-alis ng isang gate sa loob ng ilang panahon dahil sa mga isyu sa kalibrasyon, at hindi madaling gawin ang mga koreksyon sa software| Maliliit na pagbabago sa electronics na hindi nakakaapekto sa operasyon |\n"
"| |Pagbabago ng direksyon ng CNOT gate | |\n"
"<span id=\"native-gates-ops\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported instructions {#supported-instructions}"
msgstr "Mga sinusuportahang instruksyon {#supported-instructions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each [processor family](/guides/processor-types) natively supports a limited set of instructions. This set includes single- and two-qubit gates, as well as non-unitary operations such as measure and reset. Every gate in the circuit must be translated (by the transpiler) to the elements of a QPU's supported instruction set before it can run on the QPU.\n"
msgstr "Natively na sinusuportahan ng bawat [pamilya ng processor](/guides/processor-types) ang limitadong hanay ng mga instruksyon. Kasama sa hanay na ito ang mga single- at two-qubit gate, pati na rin ang mga non-unitary na operasyon tulad ng measure at reset. Bawat gate sa circuit ay dapat isalin (ng transpiler) sa mga elemento ng sinusuportahang instruction set ng isang QPU bago ito mapatakbo sa QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can view the supported instruction sets for a QPU with Qiskit. The IBM Quantum Platform Compute resources page lists only the supported unitary gates (basis gates) for a QPU.\n"
msgstr "Maaari mong makita ang mga sinusuportahang instruction set para sa isang QPU gamit ang Qiskit. Ang pahina ng Compute resources ng IBM Quantum Platform ay naglilista lamang ng mga sinusuportahang unitary gate (basis gates) para sa isang QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  <Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-native\" label=\"Find supported instructions with Qiskit\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  <Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-native\" label=\"Find supported instructions with Qiskit\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-basis\" label=\"Find basis gates on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-basis\" label=\"Find basis gates on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    Navigate to the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page to view a table of all QPUs, then click the name of any QPU to open its detailed information card. The basis gates for that QPU are listed in the Details section.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    Pumunta sa pahina ng [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) para makita ang talahanayan ng lahat ng QPU, pagkatapos ay i-click ang pangalan ng anumang QPU para buksan ang detalyadong information card nito. Ang mga basis gate para sa QPU na iyon ay nakalista sa seksyong Details.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"native-gates\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"native-gates\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Table of supported instructions {#table-of-supported-instructions}"
msgstr "Talahanayan ng mga sinusuportahang instruksyon {#table-of-supported-instructions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Operation category |  Name |\n"
"| :--- | :--- |\n"
"| Single-qubit gates | [`RZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZGate), [`SX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.SXGate), [`X`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XGate), [`ID`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.IGate), [`delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Delay) |\n"
"| Two-qubit gates | [`CZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.CZGate), [`ECR`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.ECRGate)|\n"
"| Fractional gates | [`RX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RXGate) (single-qubit), [`RZZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZZGate) (two-qubit) |\n"
"| Non-unitary instructions | [`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Measure), [`reset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Reset), [`measure_*`](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits#midcircuit), [`delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#delay) |\n"
"| Control flow | [`if_else`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.IfElseOp) (classical feedforward) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kategorya ng operasyon |  Pangalan |\n"
"| :--- | :--- |\n"
"| Single-qubit gates | [`RZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZGate), [`SX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.SXGate), [`X`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XGate), [`ID`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.IGate), [`delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Delay) |\n"
"| Two-qubit gates | [`CZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.CZGate), [`ECR`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.ECRGate)|\n"
"| Fractional gates | [`RX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RXGate) (single-qubit), [`RZZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZZGate) (two-qubit) |\n"
