msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Learn how to [build noise models](/guides/build-noise-models) to do noisy classical simulation.\n"
"- Review the [Transpiler stages](/guides/transpiler-stages) topic to learn about how the transpiler uses backend properties for circuit optimization.\n"
"- Review the [QiskitRuntime backend API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend) reference.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga Rekomendasyon\">\n"
"- Alamin kung paano [bumuo ng mga noise model](/guides/build-noise-models) para gumawa ng maingay na classical simulation.\n"
"- Suriin ang paksa ng [Mga yugto ng Transpiler](/guides/transpiler-stages) para matuto kung paano ginagamit ng transpiler ang mga katangian ng backend para sa pag-optimize ng circuit.\n"
"- Suriin ang sanggunian ng [QiskitRuntime backend API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
